{# O'Blood, Dirt and Cum v0.3 (That Guy / Coronerra). OCum "has cum on them" fact, facts only; never tells anyone how to react.
   Works around OStimNet (tetherball88), which is NOT changed:
   - OStimNet's 0401_tton_ocum_details.prompt prints "### Cum covering" plus ocum_description(actorUUID), detailed text read from OCum's RaceMenu overlays,
     and its 0501_cum_overlay.prompt tells NPCs how to notice a "### Cum covering" section.
   - If OStimNet (TT_OStimNet.esp) is loaded and ocum_description(actorUUID) is not empty, this prints NOTHING: their details stand.
   - Otherwise, if OCum still marks the actor (OCum_HasCumFaction or OCumMagicEffect: e.g. Tull / Liquid Pack / werewolf-shot meshes,
     overlays not readable because the 3D is not loaded), this prints a short fact under the same "### Cum covering" heading, so OStimNet's rule
     still applies. No body-part detail is invented. Without OStimNet the same short fact is printed under the same heading.
   - ocum_description is only called when TT_OStimNet.esp is loaded (the plugin OStimNet ships with the SKSE DLL that registers the decorator),
     and only when this would otherwise print, so it is never called without OStimNet.
   Silent when: OCum.esp is not loaded, OBDC_PromptEnabled or OBDC_CumPromptEnabled is off, or OCum does not mark the actor. #}
{% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "dialogue_target" %}
{% if get_global_value("OBDC_PromptEnabled") == 1 and get_global_value("OBDC_CumPromptEnabled") == 1 and is_plugin_loaded(lower("OCum.esp")) %}
{% if actorUUID and actorUUID != 0 %}
{% if is_in_faction(actorUUID, "OCum_HasCumFaction") or has_magic_effect(actorUUID, "OCumMagicEffect") %}
{% set obdc_osn = "" %}
{% if is_plugin_loaded(lower("TT_OStimNet.esp")) %}{% set obdc_osn = ocum_description(actorUUID) %}{% endif %}
{% if obdc_osn == "" %}
{% set obdc_actor = decnpc(actorUUID) %}
{% if obdc_actor and obdc_actor.UUID %}
### Cum covering
{% if (not is_player(actorUUID)) and (render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts") %}You have cum on you.
{% else %}{{ obdc_actor.name }} has cum on them.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
